cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "fCO2GalicIA: machine-learning ensemble for sea-air delta fCO2 in the NW Iberian upwelling system"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mfontela/fCO2GalicIA"
authors:
  - family-names: Fontela
    given-names: Marcos
    email: mfontela@iim.csic.es
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7486-0922"
    affiliation: "Instituto de Investigacions Marinas (IIM-CSIC)"
abstract: >-
  Machine-learning ensemble (Random Forest, Support Vector Regression and XGBoost)
  that estimates the sea-air difference in CO2 fugacity (delta fCO2, uatm) at the
  ocean surface of the NW Iberian upwelling system (41.5-43.0 N, 10.5-8.0 W) from
  location, date, sea surface temperature, salinity, chlorophyll-a and the coastal
  Upwelling Index.
keywords:
  - air-sea CO2 exchange
  - fCO2
  - upwelling
  - machine learning
  - NW Iberian upwelling system
